Abstract layered composition of translucent ivory and champagne glass-like planes arranged in gentle stepped arcs rising from the bottom, with each edge catching a thin line of warm gold light. Soft diffused light from above, delicate reflections and shallow depth of field lend an airy calm, and the top fades into smooth pale ivory. 8K quality, ultra smooth gradients, premium feel, no text, no letters, no UI elements, no device mockups